        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Systems: Highland Park and Lake Burien Railway, Interurban System\n- Places: Everett, Tacoma, Washington state, Pierce County, United States\n- Topics: Branch railways, county seats, port cities\n\nFacts:\n- The Highland Park and Lake Burien Railway was a branch of the Interurban System in Washington state.\n- The Interurban System ran from Everett to Tacoma in Washington state.\n- Tacoma is a mid-sized urban port city in Washington, United States.\n- Tacoma is the county seat of Pierce County, Washington.",
